msgid "tutorial.black_market_intro.title"
msgstr "Removing and Transforming"

msgid "tutorial.black_market_intro"
msgstr "The Black Market lets you shape your Gacha Collection for this run.\n\nRemove a capsule to take it out of your current collection for the rest of the run.\nRemoval costs 5 gold and increases by 1 each time for the rest of the run.\n\nTransform a capsule into a different random capsule of the same tier.\nTransforming always costs 5 gold and does not increase."

msgid "tutorial.training_grounds"
msgstr "A place to hone your hero's power. Earn tokens from the minigame to spend on these machines for permanent Power upgrades."

msgid "tutorial.gambling_den"
msgstr "Risk it all for gold. Earn tokens from the minigame to spend on these machines for immediate gold rewards."

